- Story & Context: A lone archivist, Dr. Aris Thorne, discovered a faint, harmonic resonance emanating from Sector 7's dormant cryo-pods, a chillingly beautiful tone that seemed to hum with the life it preserved. The incident sparked a low-level alert when the vault's atmospheric controls briefly flickered, and a single, unexpected bass frequency pulsed through the floor, prompting Aris to wonder, "Are the cold seeds dreaming, or just shivering?" This initial sonic anomaly, born of the seed vault's deep hum, was the true genesis of the Isotope Groove.
