Track 3: The Aris Protocol
- Story & Context: The legend grew around Dr. Aris Thorne's discovery, transforming the vault's spontaneous harmonics into "The Aris Protocol," a whispered theory that the preserved seeds themselves were broadcasting a complex, urgent message. This myth solidified after a massive solar flare caused every display in the main lab to briefly flash a vibrant, impossible spectrum of colors, while a cascading neurofunk bassline shook the very foundations, leading the vault keepers to declare, "We are the gardeners of a ghost galaxy." The music became the testament to this evolving, profound mystery.
